<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA JULY PALM OIL OUTPUT 823,000T - IVAN WONG.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA JULY PALM OIL OUTPUT 823,000T - IVAN WONG.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's palm oil output in July was estimated to be 4.5 percent higher at 823,000 tonnes against 787,807 tonnes in June, private crop forecaster Ivan Wong said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Wong estimated exports in July at 705,000 tonnes against Malaysian Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority (PORLA) at 612,124 tonnes.</p>
<p>End-July stocks were projected at 805,000 tonnes against PORLA's 786,123.</p>
</text>
